-- Fix: a 100%-discounted sale (v_total = 0) still consumes stock/ingredients
-- and has real COGS (v_total_cost > 0), but the journal posting was gated on
-- `v_total > 0` for the whole entry — so its HPP/Persediaan lines silently
-- never got posted. Decouple the two: post the Kas & Bank/Pendapatan lines
-- only when there's revenue, and the HPP/Persediaan lines independently
-- whenever there's cost, in whichever combination applies. Same fix mirrored
-- in void_transaction's reversing entry. No signature changes.

